@ServiceTicketManagement_HostAddress = http://localhost:5168

### Get all tickets
GET {{ServiceTicketManagement_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Accept: application/json

### Filter tickets
GET {{ServiceTicketManagement_HostAddress}}/api/tickets?status=InProgress&priority=High
Accept: application/json

### Ticket statistics
GET {{ServiceTicketManagement_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/statistics
Accept: application/json

### Create a ticket
POST {{ServiceTicketManagement_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Customer portal login issue",
  "description": "Investigate why a user receives an unexpected error after login.",
  "priority": "High",
  "assignee": "Application Support"
}

### Replace TICKET_ID before running
@ticketId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Get ticket by id
GET {{ServiceTicketManagement_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Accept: application/json

### Update a ticket
PUT {{ServiceTicketManagement_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Customer portal login issue",
  "description": "Investigate and reproduce the login issue reported by the customer.",
  "priority": "Critical",
  "assignee": "Backend Team"
}

### Change status
PATCH {{ServiceTicketManagement_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "InProgress"
}

### Add comment
POST {{ServiceTicketManagement_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "Washim Akram",
  "message": "Issue reproduced locally. Checking the service logs and database state."
}

### Delete ticket
DELETE {{ServiceTicketManagement_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}
